      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man leud ofslea an þeofðe, licge buton wyrgelde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person kills a man in the act of theft, let him lie without wergild.</ab>
